### Hospital Records sample requests (IntelliJ HTTP client or VS Code "REST Client" extension)
### Run the logins first, then paste each token into the variables below.
### All demo data is fictional. Demo passwords: admin = Admin@12345, everyone else = Password@123

@host = http://localhost:8080
@admin = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN
@reception = PASTE_RECEPTIONIST_TOKEN
@doctor = PASTE_DOCTOR_TOKEN
@nurse = PASTE_NURSE_TOKEN

### Login: admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@hospital.test", "password": "Admin@12345" }

### Login: receptionist
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "reception@hospital.test", "password": "Password@123" }

### Login: doctor (Dr. Rao)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "dr.rao@hospital.test", "password": "Password@123" }

### Login: nurse
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "nurse.priya@hospital.test", "password": "Password@123" }

### Admin: create a staff account
POST {{host}}/api/admin/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dr.khan@hospital.test",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "fullName": "Dr. Imran Khan",
  "role": "DOCTOR",
  "specialization": "Orthopaedics"
}

### Admin: list doctors
GET {{host}}/api/admin/staff?role=DOCTOR
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Receptionist: register a patient
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{reception}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Lakshmi Pillai",
  "dateOfBirth": "1992-09-30",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "phone": "9000000010",
  "bloodGroup": "AB+",
  "emergencyContactName": "Suresh Pillai",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "9000000011"
}

### Receptionist: search patients
GET {{host}}/api/patients?q=asha
Authorization: Bearer {{reception}}

### Receptionist: see doctors
GET {{host}}/api/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{reception}}

### Receptionist: book an appointment (change the date to a future one)
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{reception}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 2,
  "doctorId": 2,
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T11:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "reason": "Chest pain follow-up"
}

### Receptionist: the same slot again returns 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{reception}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 3,
  "doctorId": 2,
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T11:15:00",
  "durationMinutes": 30
}

### Doctor: my schedule (doctors only ever see their own)
GET {{host}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{doctor}}

### Doctor: create a clinical record (patient 1 = Asha, who has an appointment with Dr. Rao)
POST {{host}}/api/patients/1/records
Authorization: Bearer {{doctor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "diagnosis": "Mild hypertension",
  "treatment": "Lifestyle changes",
  "prescription": "Amlodipine 5 mg once daily",
  "notes": "Review in 4 weeks"
}

### Receptionist: reading the record is forbidden (403)
GET {{host}}/api/records/1
Authorization: Bearer {{reception}}

### Nurse: read-only access
GET {{host}}/api/records/1
Authorization: Bearer {{nurse}}

### Doctor: edit the record (a reason is required, the old version is kept)
PUT {{host}}/api/records/1
Authorization: Bearer {{doctor}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "diagnosis": "Hypertension stage 1",
  "treatment": "Medication started",
  "prescription": "Amlodipine 5 mg once daily",
  "notes": "BP still elevated at review",
  "changeReason": "Follow-up reading was higher"
}

### Version history of the record
GET {{host}}/api/records/1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{doctor}}

### Doctor: complete an appointment
POST {{host}}/api/appointments/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{doctor}}

### Admin: audit trail for one record
GET {{host}}/api/admin/audit?entityType=MedicalRecord&entityId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Admin: failed login attempts
GET {{host}}/api/admin/audit?action=LOGIN_FAILED
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Admin: deactivate a patient (hides from search, blocks new bookings)
PATCH {{host}}/api/patients/3/active
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": false }


### Patient: create their own login (MRN + date of birth of an existing patient without a login, e.g. one registered above)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "new.patient@example.test", "password": "Password@123", "mrn": "MRN-XXXXXXXX", "dateOfBirth": "1990-05-17" }

### Patient: log in (demo patient Asha Verma)
# @name patientLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "asha.verma@patient.test", "password": "Password@123" }

### Patient: my appointments
GET {{host}}/api/me/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientLogin.response.body.token}}

### Patient: book for myself (change the date to a future day)
POST {{host}}/api/me/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "doctorId": 2, "startTime": "2026-12-01T11:00:00", "reason": "Follow-up" }

### Patient: clinical records are not available to patients (403)
GET {{host}}/api/patients/1/records
Authorization: Bearer {{patientLogin.response.body.token}}
